<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Fig D2-1: Mirror session state machine (L8 Presentation)" id="D2_fig1_mirror_session"><mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageWidth="1480" pageHeight="985"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="hdr" value="&lt;b&gt;Smart Closet Mirror — Fig D2-1: Mirror session state machine (L8 Presentation)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Goal: Turn a Gen 1 Mirror into a closet mirror that measures the user with a Kinect, shows their own clothes and shop items on their body, and tells them what to wear today and whether a new piece is worth buying." style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="1420" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="855" width="1440" height="114" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="region" value="Awake (glass on)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 7;fillColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="175" width="980" height="480" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg5" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 7;fillColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="973.3333333333334" y="929" width="64" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="start" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="405" width="22" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="asleep" value="&lt;b&gt;Asleep&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;glass dark, camera off" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="380" width="200" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="waking" value="&lt;b&gt;Waking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;pick profile, enter PIN" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="380" width="200" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="home" value="&lt;b&gt;Home&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;today&amp;#x27;s outfit, menu" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="380" width="200" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="measuring" value="&lt;b&gt;Measuring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;T-pose guide (Fig D2-2)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="205" width="200" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tryon" value="&lt;b&gt;TryOn&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;live video (I4)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="380" width="200" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="verdict" value="&lt;b&gt;Verdict&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;buy / skip card" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="555" width="200" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="offline" value="&lt;b&gt;CameraUnknown&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#x27;Camera status unknown&amp;#x27;;&lt;br&gt;image functions blocked" style="rounded=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="720" width="280" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note1" value="Rules&lt;br&gt;• [capture on] is a guard. If capture is off, &amp;#x27;try&amp;#x27; and &amp;#x27;measure&amp;#x27; open the consent prompt (Fig D2-5);&lt;br&gt;   declining keeps the user on Home with the camera off.&lt;br&gt;• Only the unlocked user&amp;#x27;s wardrobe and cards are shown; Asleep ends the session (US-05).&lt;br&gt;• Socket loss to the WebView is handled inside the Mirror: it reconnects every 2 s (I6)." style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="720" width="690" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg0" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="895" width="64" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506.6666666666667" y="895" width="64" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg2" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#00